# CODEOWNERS — control-plane protection for the self-evolving agent system.
#
# Any path listed below requires explicit review from a CODEOWNER before a
# PR touching it can merge. Combined with main-branch protection (see
# docs/upgrade-plan.md §3.4), this is how we prevent the agent — which
# normally has write access via the shadow/issue-<n> flow — from modifying
# its own control plane.
#
# The agent is instructed (CLAUDE.md rule 6) NEVER to touch these paths.
# If the agent ever proposes changes here, the PR must be reviewed by a
# human owner. Do not weaken this list.

# --- Control plane: workflows ---
/.github/                       @CTlanston

# --- Control plane: orchestrator code (planning + dispatch) ---
/orchestrator/                  @CTlanston

# --- Control plane: validator code (heterologous Gemini judge) ---
/validator/                     @CTlanston

# --- Behavioral contract loaded by every Claude job ---
/CLAUDE.md                      @CTlanston

# --- This file itself ---
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @CTlanston

# --- Source-of-truth design document ---
/docs/upgrade-plan.md           @CTlanston

# --- Tests of the control plane (agents may add normal tests under
#     tests/, but tests/test_orchestrator_*.py and tests/test_validator_*.py
#     are part of the control plane) ---
/tests/test_orchestrator_*.py   @CTlanston
/tests/test_validator_*.py      @CTlanston
